WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.550
FlowGram Desktop. From idea to action.

00:03.550 --> 00:06.850
Describe an order workflow in chat.

00:06.850 --> 00:12.300
FlowGram builds the nodes, parallel checks and branches.

00:12.300 --> 00:14.340
Open the condition node. Start with an empty form.

00:14.340 --> 00:15.080
Choose the order.amount variable.

00:15.080 --> 00:15.880
Set the operator to Greater than.

00:15.880 --> 00:17.720
Enter the review threshold: 5000.

00:17.720 --> 00:19.150
Test the node. An order of 3200 goes to fulfillment.

00:19.150 --> 00:24.850
Run the workflow and follow each execution step.

00:24.850 --> 00:27.400
Inspect node outputs and the matched branch.

00:27.400 --> 00:32.350
Publish a version and enable HTTP and MCP access.

00:32.350 --> 00:38.150
Reuse the workflow in your apps, agents and other workflows.

00:38.150 --> 00:42.100
Switch between light and dark themes. Stay in flow.

00:42.100 --> 00:45.000
FlowGram Desktop. Build. Run. Reuse.
